---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="devjoe Garmin — Thoughtful software for the wrist"
  description="Independent Garmin apps by devjoe, designed with clarity, restraint, and care."
>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Independent Garmin software</p>
        <h1>Small surfaces. Considered details.</h1>
        <p>
          Quietly distinctive watch experiences that make dense information
          glanceable, honest, and worth wearing every day.
        </p>
        <div class="action-row">
          <a class="button primary" href="/burnished-sky-ahead/">Discover Burnished Sky Ahead</a>
          <a class="button" href="/burnished-sky-ahead/support/">Product support</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="home-product-card" href="/burnished-sky-ahead/" aria-label="Discover Burnished Sky Ahead">
        <img
          src="/images/burnished-sky-ahead/01-essentials-at-a-glance.png"
          alt="Burnished Sky Ahead watch-face composition"
          width="900"
          height="900"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <span><strong>Burnished Sky Ahead</strong><small>Time, weather, and the hours ahead</small></span>
      </a>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">First release</p>
        <h2>Burnished Sky Ahead</h2>
        <p>
          First made for a Soft Gold Titanium and French Gray Forerunner 970,
          then carefully adapted for selected round AMOLED Garmin watches.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-index">01</span>
          <h3>Weather with context</h3>
          <p>Three forecast points select the shortest useful horizon instead of filling the dial with noise.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-index">02</span>
          <h3>Made for AMOLED</h3>
          <p>A deliberate active composition and a separate low-power display protect clarity in both states.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-index">03</span>
          <h3>Honest by default</h3>
          <p>Missing weather or sensor values remain visibly unknown. The watch face never invents data.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
